  "description": "Formalises the distinction between natural entropy (emergent, intention-free) and mechanical entropy (constructed, intention-bearing) in information systems. Defines structural intention as KL-divergence from baseline dynamics. Provides three-diagnostic detection framework and thirteen falsifiable predictions.",
